## Citation Rules
- Include exact source URL.
- Include retrieval date/time (JST preferred).
- Treat price, stock, shipping, promotions, and rankings as time-sensitive.
- If freshness is uncertain, state uncertainty and direct users to the source page.

## Safety and Privacy
- Do not expose personal/account/payment/order/tracking data.
- Do not infer non-public seller or platform internal information.
- Respect robots.txt and applicable laws/terms.

## Usage Boundaries
- Do not present outdated campaign or pricing data as current.
- Do not reproduce large portions of content without attribution.
- Do not misrepresent official policies or product authenticity information.

## Product Detail Guidance
Primary product URL pattern:
https://www.qoo10.jp/g/{ItemCode}
https://www.qoo10.jp/gmkt.inc/Goods/Goods.aspx?goodscode={ItemCode}
https://m.qoo10.jp/mg/{ItemCode}
https://m.qoo10.jp/gmkt.inc/Mobile/Goods/Goods.aspx?goodscode={ItemCode}

When citing product information, prefer:
- Product title
- Current price and currency
- Shipping information
- Seller/shop name
- Availability status
- Review summary (if visible)

Important:
- Product price, stock, and shipping terms may change at any time.
- Always cite the exact product URL and retrieval time (JST).